    "startDate": "1982-09-16",
    "endDate": "30212",
    "description": "During Israeli occupation of West Beirut, Lebanon War",
    "location": {
      "@type": "Place",
      "name": "Sabra and Shatila, Beirut, Lebanon; Camps still exist; memorial sites established",
      "geo": {
